    `the body is the partnership at the time of the contravention by the contravening person referred to in section 236E(1) or 236F(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body the partnership as it was at the time of the contravention by the contravening person referred to in section 236E(1) or 236F(1), as the case may be?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 236A "partnership" in Subdivision (2) the partnership at the time of the contravention` MEANS
