§ `s 236C: civil penalty when the corporation fails to prevent or detect a contravention`

-- src:36473 | 236C.—(1) A corporation which fails to prevent or detect a
-- src:36474 | contravention of any provision in this Part committed by an
-- src:36479 | employee or officer of the corporation (called in this section the
-- src:36480 | contravening person), which contravention is —
-- src:36482 | (a) committed for the benefit of the corporation; and
-- src:36484 | (b) attributable to the negligence of the corporation,
-- src:36486 | commits a contravention and shall be liable to an order for a civil
-- src:36487 | penalty under this section.
@ref s 236C(1) (src:36473-36487)
GIVEN
    `the corporation fails to prevent or detect a contravention of a provision of Part 12 committed by its employee or officer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation fail to prevent or detect a contravention of any provision in Part 12 committed by an employee or officer of the corporation (the contravening person)?
    `the contravention was committed for the benefit of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the contravention committed for the benefit of the corporation?
    `the contravention is attributable to the negligence of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the contravention attributable to the negligence of the corporation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 236C(1) the corporation commits a contravention and is liable to an order for a civil penalty` MEANS
    IF `the corporation fails to prevent or detect a contravention of a provision of Part 12 committed by its employee or officer` AND `the contravention was committed for the benefit of the corporation` AND `the contravention is attributable to the negligence of the corporation`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A corporation which fails to prevent or detect a contravention of any provision in this Part committed by an employee or officer of the corporation" -- SPLIT-SITE (i) [OWN] -- MARGINAL-READING (b)


