§ `s 236F: civil penalty when the partnership or limited liability partnership fails to prevent or detect a contravention`

-- src:36795 | 236F.—(1) A partnership or limited liability partnership which
-- src:36796 | fails to prevent or detect a contravention of any provision in this Part
-- src:36797 | committed by a partner or employee of the partnership or a partner,
-- src:36798 | manager or employee of the limited liability partnership, as the case
-- src:36799 | may be (called in this section the contravening person), which
-- src:36800 | contravention is —
-- src:36802 | (a) committed for the benefit of the partnership or limited
-- src:36803 | liability partnership; and
-- src:36805 | (b) attributable to the negligence of the partnership or limited
-- src:36806 | liability partnership,
-- src:36808 | commits a contravention and shall be liable to an order for a civil
-- src:36809 | penalty under this section.
@ref s 236F(1) (src:36795-36809)
GIVEN
    `the partnership or limited liability partnership fails to prevent or detect a contravention of a provision of Part 12 committed by its partner, manager or employee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the partnership or limited liability partnership fail to prevent or detect a contravention of any provision in Part 12 committed by a partner or employee of the partnership or a partner, manager or employee of the limited liability partnership, as the case may be (the contravening person)?
    `the contravention was committed for the benefit of the partnership or limited liability partnership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the contravention committed for the benefit of the partnership or limited liability partnership?
    `the contravention is attributable to the negligence of the partnership or limited liability partnership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the contravention attributable to the negligence of the partnership or limited liability partnership?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 236F(1) the partnership or limited liability partnership commits a contravention and is liable to an order for a civil penalty` MEANS
    IF `the partnership or limited liability partnership fails to prevent or detect a contravention of a provision of Part 12 committed by its partner, manager or employee` AND `the contravention was committed for the benefit of the partnership or limited liability partnership` AND `the contravention is attributable to the negligence of the partnership or limited liability partnership`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A partnership or limited liability partnership which fails to prevent or detect a contravention of any provision in this Part committed by a partner or employee of the partnership or a partner, manager or employee of the limited liability partnership, as the case may be" -- SPLIT-SITE (i) [OWN] -- MARGINAL-READING (b)


