-- src:36858 | (7) For the purposes of subsection (1), in determining whether a
-- src:36859 | contravention is attributable to the negligence of a partnership or
-- src:36860 | limited liability partnership, the court is to take into account the
-- src:36861 | following matters:
-- src:36863 | (a) whether the partnership or limited liability partnership has
-- src:36864 | established adequate policies and procedures for the
-- src:36865 | purposes of preventing and detecting market misconduct;
-- src:36867 | (b) whether the partnership or limited liability partnership has
-- src:36868 | consistently enforced compliance with its policies and
-- src:36869 | procedures referred to in paragraph (a);
-- src:36871 | (c) such other factors as the court may consider relevant.
@ref s 236F(7) (src:36858-36871)
GIVEN
    `the court is determining whether a contravention is attributable to the negligence of the partnership or limited liability partnership for the purposes of subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the court determining, for the purposes of subsection (1), whether a contravention is attributable to the negligence of the partnership or limited liability partnership?
    `the matter is whether the partnership or limited liability partnership has established adequate policies and procedures for the purposes of preventing and detecting market misconduct` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the matter whether the partnership or limited liability partnership has established adequate policies and procedures for the purposes of preventing and detecting market misconduct?
    `the matter is whether the partnership or limited liability partnership has consistently enforced compliance with its policies and procedures referred to in paragraph (a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the matter whether the partnership or limited liability partnership has consistently enforced compliance with its policies and procedures referred to in paragraph (a)?
    `the matter is another factor that the court may consider relevant` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the matter another factor that the court may consider relevant?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 236F(7) the matter is one the court is to take into account in deciding negligence` MEANS
