-- src:37230 | (4) Permission under subsection (3) may not be granted if a date has
-- src:37231 | been fixed by a court under section 236K for the filing of claims, and
-- src:37236 | in that event the claimant to the proposed action or the action that has
-- src:37237 | been stayed (as the case may be) must comply with such directions
-- src:37238 | relating to the filing and proof of the claimant’s claim under
-- src:37239 | section 236K as that court may issue in the claimant’s case.
@ref s 236J(4) (src:37230-37239)
